{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "1bd91be8-a85a-4a1b-9700-e0f48b0bf076",
    "name": "Gunung Kerinci API - Mobile Complete",
    "description": "API mobile Gunung Kerinci. Folder 07 mendokumentasikan scan kehadiran di pos untuk ketua tim dan anggota. Import koleksi ini bersama environment gunung-kerinci-api.postman_environment.json, pilih environment, atur base_url, lalu Login untuk menyimpan bearer_token. Jalankan request folder 07 secara manual sesuai urutan panduan; jangan jalankan seluruh folder sebagai batch karena tiap check-in hanya berlaku sekali per pendaki/pos.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {"key": "token", "value": "{{bearer_token}}", "type": "string"}
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Accept', value: 'application/json' });"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login response received', () => pm.response.code >= 200 && pm.response.code < 500);",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const token = json?.data?.token || json?.token || json?.access_token;",
                  "if (token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('bearer_token', token);",
                  "  pm.environment.set('bearer_token', token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {"type": "noauth"},
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}},
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "login"]}
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Google Login via Access Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Google login response received', () => pm.response.code >= 200 && pm.response.code < 500);",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const token = json?.data?.token || json?.token || json?.access_token;",
                  "if (token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('bearer_token', token);",
                  "  pm.environment.set('bearer_token', token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {"type": "noauth"},
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"access_token\": \"{{google_access_token}}\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}},
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/google/token", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "google", "token"]}
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 Profile",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Pendaki Identity",
          "request": {"method": "GET", "header": [], "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/profile/pendaki-identity", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "profile", "pendaki-identity"]}},
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Biodata",
          "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["const json = pm.response.json();", "const id = json?.data?.id || json?.data?.biodata?.id || json?.data?.user?.biodata?.id;", "if (id) { pm.collectionVariables.set('kode_bio', id); pm.environment.set('kode_bio', id); }"]}}],
          "request": {"method": "GET", "header": [], "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/profile/getbiodata", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "profile", "getbiodata"]}},
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Biodata",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"first_name\": \"{{first_name}}\",\n  \"last_name\": \"{{last_name}}\",\n  \"no_hp\": \"{{no_hp}}\",\n  \"no_hp_darurat\": \"{{no_hp_darurat}}\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}},
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/profile/updatebiodata", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "profile", "updatebiodata"]}
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Ganti Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"password_lama\": \"{{password_lama}}\",\n  \"password_baru\": \"{{password_baru}}\",\n  \"password_baru_confirmation\": \"{{password_baru_confirmation}}\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}},
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/profile/gantipassword", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "profile", "gantipassword"]}
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 Beranda & Tiket Awal",
      "item": [
        {"name": "Menu Beranda", "request": {"method": "GET", "header": [], "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/beranda", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "beranda"]}}, "response": []},
        {"name": "Daftar Destinasi", "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["const json = pm.response.json();", "if (Array.isArray(json?.data) && json.data.length) {", "  pm.collectionVariables.set('destinasi_id', json.data[0].id);", "  pm.environment.set('destinasi_id', json.data[0].id);", "}"]}}], "request": {"method": "GET", "header": [], "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/destinasi", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "destinasi"]}}, "response": []},
        {"name": "Detail Destinasi", "request": {"method": "GET", "header": [], "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/destinasi/{{destinasi_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "destinasi", "{{destinasi_id}}"]}}, "response": []},
        {"name": "Paket Tiket Destinasi", "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["const json = pm.response.json();", "if (Array.isArray(json?.data?.paket) && json.data.paket.length) {", "  pm.collectionVariables.set('paket_id', json.data.paket[0].id);", "  pm.environment.set('paket_id', json.data.paket[0].id);", "}"]}}], "request": {"method": "GET", "header": [], "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/destinasi/{{destinasi_id}}/paket", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "destinasi", "{{destinasi_id}}", "paket"]}}, "response": []},
        {"name": "Detail Tiket Paket", "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["const json = pm.response.json();", "const gates = json?.data?.destinasi?.gates || [];", "if (gates.length) {", "  pm.collectionVariables.set('gate_masuk_id', gates[0].id);", "  pm.collectionVariables.set('gate_keluar_id', gates[gates.length - 1].id);", "  pm.environment.set('gate_masuk_id', gates[0].id);", "  pm.environment.set('gate_keluar_id', gates[gates.length - 1].id);", "}"]}}], "request": {"method": "GET", "header": [], "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/destinasi/paket/{{paket_id}}/tiket", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "destinasi", "paket", "{{paket_id}}", "tiket"]}}, "response": []}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04 Booking",
      "item": [
        {"name": "Create/Update Booking Awal", "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["const json = pm.response.json();", "if (json?.data?.id) { pm.collectionVariables.set('booking_id', json.data.id); pm.environment.set('booking_id', json.data.id); }", "if (Array.isArray(json?.data?.pendakis) && json.data.pendakis.length) {", "  pm.collectionVariables.set('pendaki_id', json.data.pendakis[0].id);", "  pm.collectionVariables.set('kode_bio', json.data.pendakis[0].id_bio);", "  pm.environment.set('pendaki_id', json.data.pendakis[0].id);", "  pm.environment.set('kode_bio', json.data.pendakis[0].id_bio);", "}"]}}], "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"date_start\": \"{{date_start}}\",\n  \"date_end\": \"{{date_end}}\",\n  \"wni\": {{wni}},\n  \"wna\": {{wna}},\n  \"jenis_tiket\": \"{{paket_id}}\",\n  \"gerbang_masuk\": \"{{gate_masuk_id}}\",\n  \"gerbang_keluar\": \"{{gate_keluar_id}}\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}, "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/booking/destinasi/paket/tiket", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "booking", "destinasi", "paket", "tiket"]}}, "response": []},
        {"name": "Detail Booking", "request": {"method": "GET", "header": [], "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/booking/{{booking_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "booking", "{{booking_id}}"]}}, "response": []},
        {"name": "Setujui SNK", "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"id\": \"{{booking_id}}\",\n  \"snk\": true\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}, "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/booking/snk", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "booking", "snk"]}}, "response": []},
        {"name": "Data Formulir", "request": {"method": "GET", "header": [], "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/booking/{{booking_id}}/formulir", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "booking", "{{booking_id}}", "formulir"]}}, "response": []},
        {"name": "Tambah Pendaki", "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["const json = pm.response.json();", "const pendakis = json?.data?.pendakis || [];", "if (pendakis.length) {", "  const last = pendakis[pendakis.length - 1];", "  pm.collectionVariables.set('pendaki_tambahan_id', last.id);", "  pm.environment.set('pendaki_tambahan_id', last.id);", "}"]}}], "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"booking\": \"{{booking_id}}\",\n  \"code\": \"{{kode_bio_tambahan}}\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}, "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/booking/formulir/pendaki/add", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "booking", "formulir", "pendaki", "add"]}}, "response": []},
        {"name": "Update Pendaki", "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"booking\": \"{{booking_id}}\",\n  \"id\": \"{{pendaki_tambahan_id}}\",\n  \"code\": \"{{kode_bio_tambahan}}\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}, "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/booking/formulir/pendaki/add", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "booking", "formulir", "pendaki", "add"]}}, "response": []},
        {"name": "Simpan Formulir", "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"id_booking\": \"{{booking_id}}\",\n  \"action\": \"save\",\n  \"formulir\": [\n    {\n      \"id_pendaki\": \"{{pendaki_id}}\",\n      \"kode_bio\": \"{{kode_bio}}\",\n      \"no_hp_darurat\": \"{{no_hp_darurat}}\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"barang_bawaan\": [\n    {\"nama_barang\": \"Carrier\", \"jumlah\": 1}\n  ]\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}, "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/booking/formulir", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "booking", "formulir"]}}, "response": []},
        {"name": "Finalisasi Formulir", "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"id_booking\": \"{{booking_id}}\",\n  \"action\": \"next\",\n  \"barangWajib\": true,\n  \"formulir\": [\n    {\n      \"id_pendaki\": \"{{pendaki_id}}\",\n      \"kode_bio\": \"{{kode_bio}}\",\n      \"no_hp_darurat\": \"{{no_hp_darurat}}\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"barang_bawaan\": [\n    {\"nama_barang\": \"Carrier\", \"jumlah\": 1}\n  ]\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}, "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/booking/formulir", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "booking", "formulir"]}}, "response": []}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "05 Payment & Output",
      "item": [
        {"name": "Detail Booking Review", "request": {"method": "GET", "header": [], "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/booking/{{booking_id}}/detail", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "booking", "{{booking_id}}", "detail"]}}, "response": []},
        {"name": "Data Payment", "request": {"method": "GET", "header": [], "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/booking/{{booking_id}}/payment", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "booking", "{{booking_id}}", "payment"]}}, "response": []},
        {"name": "Upload Bukti Pembayaran", "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["const json = pm.response.json();", "const payments = json?.data?.pembayaran || [];", "if (payments.length) {", "  const last = payments[payments.length - 1];", "  pm.collectionVariables.set('payment_id', last.id);", "  pm.environment.set('payment_id', last.id);", "}"]}}], "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [], "body": {"mode": "formdata", "formdata": [{"key": "id", "value": "{{booking_id}}", "type": "text"}, {"key": "metode", "value": "transfer", "type": "text"}, {"key": "bukti_pembayaran", "type": "file", "src": ""}]}, "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/booking/payment", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "booking", "payment"]}}, "response": []},
        {"name": "Hapus Bukti Pembayaran", "request": {"method": "DELETE", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"booking_id\": \"{{booking_id}}\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}, "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/booking/payment/{{payment_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "booking", "payment", "{{payment_id}}"]}}, "response": []},
        {"name": "Struk", "request": {"method": "GET", "header": [], "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/booking/{{booking_id}}/struk", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "booking", "{{booking_id}}", "struk"]}}, "response": []},
        {"name": "Tiket", "request": {"method": "GET", "header": [], "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/booking/{{booking_id}}/tiket", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "booking", "{{booking_id}}", "tiket"]}}, "response": []},
        {"name": "My Tiket", "request": {"method": "GET", "header": [], "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/mytiket", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "mytiket"]}}, "response": []},
        {"name": "Cancel Booking", "request": {"method": "DELETE", "header": [], "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/booking/{{booking_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "booking", "{{booking_id}}"]}}, "response": []}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "06 Security Negative Tests",
      "item": [
        {"name": "Booking UUID Palsu", "request": {"method": "GET", "header": [], "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/booking/{{fake_booking_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "booking", "{{fake_booking_id}}"]}}, "response": []},
        {"name": "Detail Destinasi ID Non Numeric", "request": {"method": "GET", "header": [], "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/destinasi/abc", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "destinasi", "abc"]}}, "response": []},
        {"name": "Tambah Pendaki Kode Tidak Valid", "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}], "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"booking\": \"{{booking_id}}\",\n  \"code\": \"{{fake_kode_bio}}\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}, "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/booking/formulir/pendaki/add", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "booking", "formulir", "pendaki", "add"]}}, "response": []},
        {"name": "Upload Bukti Pembayaran Tanpa File", "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [], "body": {"mode": "formdata", "formdata": [{"key": "id", "value": "{{booking_id}}", "type": "text"}, {"key": "metode", "value": "transfer", "type": "text"}]}, "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/booking/payment", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "booking", "payment"]}}, "response": []}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "07 Pelacakan Jejak - Kehadiran QR",
      "description": "## Mulai di Postman\n1. Import koleksi ini dan gunung-kerinci-api.postman_environment.json, pilih environment Gunung Kerinci API. Isi base_url tanpa garis miring di akhir, misalnya http://127.0.0.1:8000. Jangan simpan kredensial atau token asli di repo.\n2. Booking harus berstatus status_booking=6 (Check in). Ketua tim adalah user dengan id yang sama seperti id_user di booking. Akun ketua dan anggota harus punya id_bio masing-masing yang tercatat dalam pendakis booking aktif tersebut. Jika tidak, API menolak scan dengan 403.\n3. Login di folder 01 Auth dengan email/password ketua. Skrip Login mengisi bearer_token; auth folder 07 diwarisi dari koleksi. Buka Detail Booking di folder 04 dengan booking_id milik ketua; baca data.id, data.gate_masuk, dan data.pendakis[].id. Simpan booking_id dan pendaki_id (ID pendaki ketua) serta pendaki_tambahan_id (ID pendaki anggota) di environment. Field pendaki_id adalah ID baris pendaki, bukan id_bio atau ID user. Detail Booking hanya bisa diakses pemilik booking; anggota meminta ID-nya ke ketua/aplikasi lewat data booking yang telah diotorisasi, atau melihat data.hikers[].pendaki_id pada Progress Tim.\n4. Panggil Daftar Pos Jalur memakai gate_masuk dari booking. Scan QR fisik pada pos untuk mendapatkan qr_code_value, lalu isi checkpoint_qr_value di environment. Daftar Pos Jalur tidak mengembalikan qr_code_value. Jangan mengira post_id, nama pos, atau nilai contoh sebagai isi QR yang sah.\n5. Kirim Scan QR Kehadiran Sendiri dengan token ketua. Kemudian kirim Ketua Wakili Kehadiran Anggota dengan token ketua, pendaki_tambahan_id yang benar, serta QR pos yang sama. Baca data.pendaki_id dan data.progress dari setiap hasil, lalu panggil Progress Tim untuk status semua anggota.\n6. Untuk mencoba hak anggota: jalankan Login lagi dengan email/password anggota sehingga bearer_token berganti. Kirim Scan QR Kehadiran Sendiri untuk pos lain yang belum dicatat, lalu Anggota Dilarang Wakili Pendaki Lain dengan pendaki_id ketua. Anggota tetap mendapat 403 untuk perwakilan. Jangan bagikan token ketua ke perangkat anggota.\n\n## Integrasi aplikasi\nSesudah scan QR, kirim POST /api/tracking/checkpoint/qr dengan header Authorization: Bearer <token>, Accept: application/json, Content-Type: application/json. Tanpa pendaki_id berarti kehadiran akun sendiri. Tampilkan pemilihan anggota hanya untuk ketua booking; setiap pilihan mengirim satu request dengan pendaki_id pendaki dalam booking yang sama. Server memeriksa hak akses walaupun UI menyembunyikan pilihan. Gunakan data.pendaki_id untuk memastikan pemilik log; data.progress adalah progress orang yang baru dicatat. Perbarui status tim lewat GET /api/tracking/progress/{booking_id}. Satu pendaki hanya punya satu log per pos per booking, termasuk bila sudah diwakili ketua. Ulang request di pos yang sama menghasilkan 409, bukan log kedua. QR harus milik pos yang aktif; kode 404 menandakan QR tidak valid atau pos nonaktif.\n\n## Status API\nPOST QR: 201 berhasil, 401 token tidak ada/tidak sah, 403 akun tanpa pendakian aktif atau anggota mencoba mewakili atau target bukan anggota booking aktif, 404 QR tidak valid/nonaktif, 409 sudah check-in, 422 input tidak valid. GET progress: 200 pemilik/anggota booking, 401 tanpa token, 404 booking tidak tersedia untuk akun tersebut. Semua respons memakai success, message, data, errors.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Daftar Pos Jalur",
          "request": {
            "description": "GET /api/tracking/posts/{gate_id}. Wajib Bearer token. Isi gate_masuk_id dari data.gate_masuk pada Detail Booking. Response 200 berisi data: array {id, nama, urutan, latitude, longitude, altitude, radius_meter} untuk pos aktif pada jalur. Pakai untuk daftar pos dan peta; endpoint ini tidak menampilkan qr_code_value. Kode QR diperoleh lewat scan fisik di pos.",
            "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/tracking/posts/{{gate_masuk_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "tracking", "posts", "{{gate_masuk_id}}"]}
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Progress Tim (Ketua / Anggota)",
          "request": {
            "description": "GET /api/tracking/progress/{booking_id}. Path booking_id adalah UUID booking; tidak ada body. Wajib Bearer token milik ketua atau pendaki di booking tersebut. Contoh 200: {\"success\":true,\"message\":\"Success\",\"data\":{\"booking_id\":\"<uuid>\",\"gate\":\"Pintu Masuk\",\"total_posts\":2,\"hikers\":[{\"pendaki_id\":\"<uuid>\",\"nama\":\"Nama Pendaki\",\"completed\":1,\"total\":2,\"percentage\":50,\"checkpoints\":[{\"post_id\":1,\"nama\":\"Pos 1\",\"urutan\":1,\"completed\":true,\"checked_at\":\"2026-09-29T08:00:00.000Z\",\"method\":\"qr\"}]}]},\"errors\":null}. Untuk UI gunakan hikers[].checkpoints[].completed/checked_at/method. Orang luar menerima 404, tanpa token 401. Progress menghitung log masing-masing pendaki.",
            "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/tracking/progress/{{booking_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "tracking", "progress", "{{booking_id}}"]}
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Scan QR Kehadiran Sendiri",
          "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": ["pm.test('Kehadiran sendiri tercatat', () => {", "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);", "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.pendaki_id).to.be.a('string');", "});"]}}],
          "request": {
